    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seafrog </strong>is a 2.5D action-platformer mashed with the movement of lite-skateboarding. Grind, kick-flip and find the flow with a rocket-powered wrench that moves smoother than a buttered beluga!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A SEA-SLICK PLATFORMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">String together combos by using a simple auto-trick system, landing grinds on fat rats and rusty pipes to fuel up your rocket-wrench! Use the fuel to boost through enemies, fly straight up walls, and stick to ceilings in order to complete over 100 handcrafted challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE RUN DOWN SHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter in Seafrog is based on a ships theme. Battle vengeful Viking ghosts aboard the Sea Dragon. Dig in for an unsavory meal aboard the Chunky Chacken, where you\u2019ll discover a man-eating chicken outbreak. Finally, get ready for some monkey business at The Sweater Factory, an abandoned workshop run by an unexpected crew of apes causing all the ruckus. Each chapter holds a Master Gear, guarded by an ultimate boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER GEAR, HO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle the legendary Skraken, Metal Beak the Momma Chacken, and... Gerald. Face these colorful 'n crusty foes to retrieve the Master Gears and repair your cannon. Blast yourself to a stranded seaplane to escape the <i>seahole</i>, a mysterious sinking hole in the ocean\u2026 before ye end up in Davy Jones' Locker!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8-12 hours of story campaign featuring three boss encounters to test your moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with a  colorful cast of characters suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and Combine 24 Mod Chips to customize your play, adjust them for more relaxed play or crank up your stats for a more difficult challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ hours to 100% item collection in every map location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour every room to uncover over 120 hidden Snakestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the campaign and solve the mystery of the seahole.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seafrog </strong>is a 2.5D action-platformer mashed with the movement of lite-skateboarding. Grind, kick-flip and find the flow with a rocket-powered wrench that moves smoother than a buttered beluga!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A SEA-SLICK PLATFORMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">String together combos by using a simple auto-trick system, landing grinds on fat rats and rusty pipes to fuel up your rocket-wrench! Use the fuel to boost through enemies, fly straight up walls, and stick to ceilings in order to complete over 100 handcrafted challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE RUN DOWN SHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter in Seafrog is based on a ships theme. Battle vengeful Viking ghosts aboard the Sea Dragon. Dig in for an unsavory meal aboard the Chunky Chacken, where you\u2019ll discover a man-eating chicken outbreak. Finally, get ready for some monkey business at The Sweater Factory, an abandoned workshop run by an unexpected crew of apes causing all the ruckus. Each chapter holds a Master Gear, guarded by an ultimate boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER GEAR, HO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle the legendary Skraken, Metal Beak the Momma Chacken, and... Gerald. Face these colorful 'n crusty foes to retrieve the Master Gears and repair your cannon. Blast yourself to a stranded seaplane to escape the <i>seahole</i>, a mysterious sinking hole in the ocean\u2026 before ye end up in Davy Jones' Locker!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.poster.avif?t=1750872943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.webm?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.mp4?t=1750872943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8-12 hours of story campaign featuring three boss encounters to test your moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with a  colorful cast of characters suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and Combine 24 Mod Chips to customize your play, adjust them for more relaxed play or crank up your stats for a more difficult challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ hours to 100% item collection in every map location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour every room to uncover over 120 hidden Snakestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the campaign and solve the mystery of the seahole.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Master Seafrog's rocket-powered wrench as you grind on enemies, catch big air, and chain epic combos to repair lost ships at sea in this exhilarating 2.5D action-puzzle-platformer!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
